Changelog: 11-10-2026 08:49:10

Create the standalone desktop app under apps/dependency-checker/portal-dependency-checker. Its catalog covers
Python runtime packages and external tools used across the suite; it checks PyPI versions and local tool
availability without installing or changing anything.
